{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/golf-town","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":829,"crm_id":null,"search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Golf Town","slug":"golf-town","display_address":"Damac Hills","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"Ready","developer":"Damac Properties","price":1070000,"display_price":"1.07M","lattitude":25.02169265,"longitude":55.2535990151426,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Golf Town by Damac located in Damac Hills is the perfect place to find your new home. If you are a golf lover, this is what you have been looking for. Offering <strong>studios, and 1, 2, 3 bedroom apartments,</strong> Golf Town is perfectly located amidst lush green surroundings.</p><p>You can access the Trump International Golf Club and live in a home with direct views of the lush green fairways and enclaves. Nestled within Dubailand, Damac Hills is a self-sufficient community just minutes away from Mall of Emirates, Madinat Jumeirah, Dubai Marina, and the Dubai International Airport. It is in proximity to the community school as well as medical centres. Golf Town is also close to the 4 million sq.ft. themed gardens, sporting areas, skate park, and stables.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/golf_town_feature_fb9d7cc4f8.jpg","hash":"golf_town_feature_fb9d7cc4f8","name":"Golf Town by Damac Properties"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/golf_town_banner_1f91dfc9c0.jpg","hash":"golf_town_banner_1f91dfc9c0","name":"Golf Town by Damac Properties"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/golf_town_5_d107b82fa3.jpg","hash":"golf_town_5_d107b82fa3","name":"Golf Town by Damac Properties"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu